dhcp: Keep every segment's subnets on the cached network

Since 06bc855dcf (2024) call_driver has set network.subnets to each
segment's subnets in turn on the caller's network, often the cached
one, and never restored them, so it kept only the last segment's.

Each segment's driver call now gets a shallow copy holding only its
subnets. The copy shares the ports list, which DeviceManager.setup
extends and the next segment's stale device cleanup reads.

